App icon overrides for the Adwaita-Accent icon theme (copied in by ~/.local/bin/theme-accent-sync).
Any NAME.svg here replaces the app icon NAME. Chosen 2026-11-15:
  com.mitchellh.ghostty.svg  Ghostty, from WhiteSur-icon-theme 2026-09-10 (GPL-3.0, vinceliuice)
  davinci-resolve.svg        DaVinci Resolve, WhiteSur resolve.svg (same source)
The Files icon (org.gnome.Nautilus) is generated by the script from the accent-coloured folder.
